    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11146" root="خفى" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفًا</span></b>  [more properly written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفًى</span>] <i>A thing that
is unperceived</i> or <i>imperceptible,</i> [or <i>hardly perceived</i> or <i>perceptible,</i>] <i>unapparent,</i> or <i>not apparent;</i> [<i>latent; obscure;</i> &amp;c.; (see 1, first sentence;)]
(JK, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَافِيَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَافٍ</span></b>  [for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَىْءٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَافٍ</span>, the explanation in the JK]. (K.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفَآءٌ</span>.]

